{"id": "city-college-career-and-foster-grant-time-records", "title": "City College’s career and foster care grants lacked timely payroll checks", "seconds": 44.6, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "656afa8872e0b22c", "words": 128, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two paths brought federal grants to City College.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.7, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Two", "paths", "to", "the", "same", "college"], "sub": "Two grant streams paid for distinct programs", "source": "career"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Career education funds came through the state. Foster care funds came through the city.", "t0": 2.82, "t1": 7.22, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "foster", "kicker": "Two grant streams paid for distinct programs", "text": "Follow both awards", "mark": "Follow"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Together the programs spent about $1.52 million.", "t0": 7.34, "t1": 10.79, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "career", "layout": "table", "heading": "Two pass-throughs", "context": "FY2022–23 expenditures", "rows": [{"label": "Career education", "value": "$878,860"}, {"label": "Foster care", "value": "$642,368"}, {"label": "Total", "value": "$1,521,228"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Of that total, $832,331 was for salaries and benefits.", "t0": 11.01, "t1": 16.28, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "finding", "layout": "table", "heading": "Salaries and benefits", "context": "Two awards", "rows": [{"label": "Payroll", "value": "$832,331"}, {"label": "Questioned costs", "value": "$0"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The college did not consistently verify employee time promptly.", "t0": 16.4, "t1": 19.67, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "finding", "kicker": "Payroll certification was irregular or late", "text": "The missing control", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The audit questioned no costs in either program.", "t0": 19.79, "t1": 22.31, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "finding", "kicker": "Payroll certification was irregular or late", "text": "The financial finding", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "An earlier finding had concerned a different program, adult education.", "t0": 22.43, "t1": 25.93, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "adult", "kicker": "An earlier payroll finding involved a different grant", "text": "A separate earlier case", "mark": "A"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "There the auditors had identified $62,206 in known questioned costs.", "t0": 26.05, "t1": 31.06, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "adult", "layout": "table", "heading": "Earlier adult education audit", "context": "FY2020", "rows": [{"label": "Known questioned costs", "value": "$62,206"}, {"label": "Population projection", "value": "$88,505"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The later audit called the career and foster funding finding new.", "t0": 31.18, "t1": 34.39, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "An earlier payroll finding involved a different grant", "text": "Different awards and periods", "mark": "Different"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "City College proposed a time certification module and targeted June 2024.", "t0": 34.61, "t1": 39.26, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "The next audit reported implementation", "text": "The district’s response", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The next audit recorded implementation.", "t0": 39.38, "t1": 41.39, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closed", "kicker": "The next audit reported implementation", "text": "The follow-up", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 41.51, "t1": 43.73, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Two grant streams paid for distinct programs", "b": "Payroll certification was irregular or late", "o": "The next audit reported implementation"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "question"}